# 🚀 TaskBoost

Complete Tasks • Earn Rewards • Withdraw Easily

TaskBoost is a modern earning platform where users can discover real earning opportunities, complete simple tasks and earn rewards.

## Features

- Daily Tasks
- Crypto Offers
- Referral System
- Wallet Support
- Blog System
- User Dashboard
- Notifications
- Mobile Friendly Design

## Tech Stack

- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: PHP
- Database: MySQL
- Hosting: ProFreeHost
- Repository: GitHub
- License: MIT

